{"4078620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pythagoras", "steam_appid": 4078620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mathematical skills. Master trigonometry to solve its mysteries and explore the fascinating world of mathematical experiments. Explore Pythagoras Space station in this sci-fi first person puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/a4ddfd912b868b068facac925b36b840.poster.avif?t=1786892851\" width=924 height=523 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/a4ddfd912b868b068facac925b36b840.webm?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the clues and information in your environment to successfully complete experiments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/673c7ce788be79b706cc36728bce3f22.poster.avif?t=1786892851\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/673c7ce788be79b706cc36728bce3f22.webm?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/673c7ce788be79b706cc36728bce3f22.mp4?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with all kind of advanced devices on the space station to enhance your understanding of how triangles work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/712c51d4913b092d31c62ececa01536d.poster.avif?t=1786892851\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/712c51d4913b092d31c62ececa01536d.webm?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/712c51d4913b092d31c62ececa01536d.mp4?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Hands-On Trigonometry Puzzles:</strong> Step into the role of a new scientist and master the fundamentals of <strong>trigonometry</strong> through immersive, first-person, environmental puzzles. Manipulate objects to create triangles and use the devices on board to maintain the experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Educational Immersive Sim:</strong> Experience a blend of genres, combining the intellectual challenge of <strong>puzzle games with immersive exploration</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Corporate Retro-Futuristic Space Station:</strong> Uncover the secrets of the <strong>&quot;Pythagoras&quot; research station</strong> with a distinct <strong>low-poly aesthetic</strong>. Journey through four visually distinct biomes—from the sterile <strong>Trigonometric Core</strong> to the vibrant <strong>Geometric Garden</strong>—each with its own set of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 different challenges focusing on different topics of trigonometry.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mathematical skills. Master trigonometry to solve its mysteries and explore the fascinating world of mathematical experiments. Explore Pythagoras Space station in this sci-fi first person puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/a4ddfd912b868b068facac925b36b840.poster.avif?t=1786892851\" width=924 height=523 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/a4ddfd912b868b068facac925b36b840.webm?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the clues and information in your environment to successfully complete experiments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/673c7ce788be79b706cc36728bce3f22.poster.avif?t=1786892851\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/673c7ce788be79b706cc36728bce3f22.webm?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/673c7ce788be79b706cc36728bce3f22.mp4?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with all kind of advanced devices on the space station to enhance your understanding of how triangles work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/712c51d4913b092d31c62ececa01536d.poster.avif?t=1786892851\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/712c51d4913b092d31c62ececa01536d.webm?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/extras/712c51d4913b092d31c62ececa01536d.mp4?t=1786892851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Hands-On Trigonometry Puzzles:</strong> Step into the role of a new scientist and master the fundamentals of <strong>trigonometry</strong> through immersive, first-person, environmental puzzles. Manipulate objects to create triangles and use the devices on board to maintain the experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Educational Immersive Sim:</strong> Experience a blend of genres, combining the intellectual challenge of <strong>puzzle games with immersive exploration</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Corporate Retro-Futuristic Space Station:</strong> Uncover the secrets of the <strong>&quot;Pythagoras&quot; research station</strong> with a distinct <strong>low-poly aesthetic</strong>. Journey through four visually distinct biomes—from the sterile <strong>Trigonometric Core</strong> to the vibrant <strong>Geometric Garden</strong>—each with its own set of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 different challenges focusing on different topics of trigonometry.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Test your mathematical skills. Master trigonometry to solve its mysteries and explore the fascinating world of mathematical experiments. Explore Pythagoras Space station in this sci-fi first person puzzle game.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/f8b66ffe81b8158f39d0bd5171bfec2b074d7d97/header.jpg?t=1786892851", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/efc91cdd182ed2fe9eb92cb439eadeb172a7f3e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786892851", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078620/efc91cdd182ed2fe9eb92cb439eadeb172a7f3e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786892851", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong>